WOLF SHAPER @RELEASE_TAG@: THE COMPLETE SOURCE CODE
====================================================

This is the complete source code of Wolf Shaper @RELEASE_TAG@ for Mac, a
modified version of Wolf Shaper v1.0.2 by Patrick Desaulniers
(https://github.com/wolf-plugins/wolf-shaper). Sonic Weaponry changed it in
October and November 2026 so that racks and projects saved with Wolf
Shaper's VST3 on Windows open on Mac. The release notes say what changed:
https://github.com/sonic-weaponry/wolf-shaper/releases/tag/@RELEASE_TAG@

This folder holds exactly these three commits, every file as committed:
  .                           @COMMIT@
                              https://github.com/sonic-weaponry/wolf-shaper
  dpf                         @DPF_COMMIT@
                              https://github.com/sonic-weaponry/DPF
  dpf/dgl/src/pugl-upstream   @PUGL_COMMIT@
                              https://github.com/DISTRHO/pugl (unchanged)

Wolf Shaper is free software under the GNU General Public License, version 3
(LICENSE). DPF and pugl are under the ISC license (dpf/LICENSE,
dpf/dgl/src/pugl-upstream/COPYING); the other parts and their licenses are
listed in packaging/macos/CREDITS.txt.in.

How we build it: .github/workflows/build.yml (the job "macos" builds the Mac
VST3); packaging/macos/make_pkg.sh builds the installer.

Wolf Shaper's authors don't endorse Sonic Weaponry.

The Sonic Weaponry Team


